            {
              "id": "L028",
              "startSec": 108.1,
              "endSec": 110.457,
              "text": "短所は頑固なところ"
            },
            {
              "id": "L029",
              "startSec": 110.457,
              "endSec": 112.594,
              "text": "I like to stick to my principles"
            },
            {
              "id": "L030",
              "startSec": 112.594,
              "endSec": 114.83,
              "text": "いつも前向きに行こうよ"
            },
            {
              "id": "L031",
              "startSec": 114.834,
              "endSec": 117.063,
              "text": "それがモットー",
              "comments": [
                {
                  "role": "human",
                  "text": "修正社区 LRC 空耳误听 'それが元' -> 官方歌词 'それがモットー'（Motto）"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "L032",
              "startSec": 117.063,
              "endSec": 119.27,
              "text": "I'm gonna make it to the top"
            },
            {
              "id": "L033",
              "startSec": 119.304,
              "endSec": 121.55,
              "text": "夢を叶えたいの",
              "comments": [
                {
                  "role": "human",
                  "text": "修正社区 LRC 假名笔误 '夢を叶いたいの' -> 官方歌词 '夢を叶えたいの'"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "L034",
              "startSec": 121.556,
              "endSec": 125.841,
              "text": "But when I do I can promise I won't stop (yeah right)"
            },
            {
              "id": "L035",
              "startSec": 125.841,
              "endSec": 127.96,
              "text": "Try me! Try me!"
            },
            {
              "id": "L036",
              "startSec": 127.96,
              "endSec": 130.25,
              "text": "'Cause I bet I got what you really need"
            },
            {
              "id": "L037",
              "startSec": 130.264,
              "endSec": 134.77,
              "text": "I'm quick to learn and I can work with people in a team"
            },
            {
              "id": "L038",
              "startSec": 134.792,
              "endSec": 136.835,
              "text": "Try me! Try me!"
            },
            {
              "id": "L039",
              "startSec": 136.835,
              "endSec": 139.29,
              "text": "Did you know I can do anything?"
            },
            {
              "id": "L040",
              "startSec": 139.32,
              "endSec": 143.987,
              "text": "Just witness this impressive list of my activities"
            },
            {
              "id": "L041",
              "startSec": 143.987,
              "endSec": 146.239,
              "text": "Step by step, 少しずつ"
            },
            {
              "id": "L042",
              "startSec": 146.239,
              "endSec": 148.44,
              "text": "高く高く登る"
            },
            {
              "id": "L043",
              "startSec": 148.44,
              "endSec": 150.78,
              "text": "踊り場に着いたら"
            },
            {
              "id": "L044",
              "startSec": 150.825,
              "endSec": 152.93,
              "text": "休憩タイムで一休み",
              "comments": [
                {
                  "role": "human",
                  "text": "与官方歌词对齐：'休憩タイムで一休み'"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "L045",
              "startSec": 152.93,
              "endSec": 155.063,
              "text": "Think about where I'm going to go"
            },
            {
              "id": "L046",
              "startSec": 155.063,
              "endSec": 157.44,
              "text": "階段登れば登るほど"
            },
            {
              "id": "L047",
              "startSec": 157.44,
              "endSec": 159.695,
              "text": "景色がきれいになってゆく"
            },
            {
              "id": "L048",
              "startSec": 159.695,
              "endSec": 162.48,
              "text": "終わりには何が待っている？"
            },
            {
              "id": "L049",
              "startSec": 162.48,
              "endSec": 165.97,
              "text": "But sometimes if I think too hard"
            },
            {
              "id": "L050",
              "startSec": 165.97,
              "endSec": 170.62,
              "text": "I forget that I'm a superstar"
            },
            {
              "id": "L051",
              "startSec": 170.701,
              "endSec": 172.93,
              "text": "Try me! Try me!"
            },
            {
              "id": "L052",
              "startSec": 172.989,
              "endSec": 175.22,
              "text": "'Cause I bet I've got what you really need"
            },
            {
              "id": "L053",
