              "endSec": 190.926,
              "text": "Try me! Try me!"
            },
            {
              "id": "L058",
              "startSec": 190.926,
              "endSec": 193.15,
              "text": "'Cause I bet I've got what you really need"
            },
            {
              "id": "L059",
              "startSec": 193.178,
              "endSec": 197.52,
              "text": "I'm quick to learn and I can work with people in a team"
            },
            {
              "id": "L060",
              "startSec": 197.52,
